<title>FRANCE: ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S DOWNHILL PRACTICE TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S DOWNHILL PRACTICE TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>CHAMONIX, France 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times in a men's</p>
<p>World Cup Alpine skiing downhill practice on Wednesday:</p>
<p> 1. Luc Alphand (France)    one minute 49.42 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Urs Lehmann (Switzerland)	     1.30 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Adrien Duvillard (France)	     1.46</p>
<p> 4. Hermann Maier (Austria)		 1.69</p>
<p> 5. Michael Brunner (Germany)	     1.77</p>
<p> 6 equal. Markus Herrmann (Switzerland) 1.89</p>
<p> 6 equal. Luke Sauder (Canada)	    1.89</p>
<p> 8. Bruno Kernen (Switzerland)	    1.96</p>
<p> 9. Patrick Ortlieb (Austria)	     1.99</p>
<p> 10. Berni Huber (Germany)		  2.00</p>
